":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Drix","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Drix#:~:text=In%20exchange%20for%20the%20secrets%20of%20FTL%20travel","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Drix\", section \"History\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."},{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Pinnacle","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Pinnacle","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Pinnacle#:~:text=This%20alliance%20encountered%20the,them%20into%20Pinnacle%20administration","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Pinnacle\", section \"History\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}]},{"text":"Pinnacle promised to visit whenever a star was about to die and help the Drix search the dying system.","cites":["drix-e2"],"links":["https://mtg.wiki/page/Drix#:~:text=The%20Drix%20also%20received,promise%20from%20Pinnacle%20."],"citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Drix","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Drix","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Drix#:~:text=The%20Drix%20also%20received,promise%20from%20Pinnacle%20.","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Drix\", section \"History\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}]},{"text":"One account calls Pinnacle parasitized by the Drix, and a narrator calls Sami's rescue of Alpharael a deliberate intervention against Pinnacle.","cites":["edge-of-eternities-episode-5-r7","edge-of-eternities-episode-5-e17"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-of-eternities-episode-5#:~:text=Pinnacle%20is%20parasitized%20by,Drix%20know%20too%20much.","https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-of-eternities-episode-5#:~:text=Pinnacle%20must%20be%20disrupted."],"citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Edge of Eternities | Episode 5","series":"Magic Story","auth